  message: "BRANCH WORK 2026-10-03 (not integrated, no status change): branch jgstern-agent/fix/sofuh, worktree ~/hg_wt/sofuh, commits 4b50aaba1a f09e820bf8 6eae9b63d6 76bd663bfd 5328479c58. smart-test (326 affected files): 10340 passed, 0 failed, 2 xfailed, mypy ratchet clean, changed sources at 100% coverage. Full report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/sofuh.md.\nFix (f09e820bf8): subscript_expression callees enter the member cascade. Literal identifier key = the dotted call: ws['send'](x) -> javascript:WebSocket:0-0:send:unresolved, method construct, tags net_send (base: zero edges for that and 8 sibling spellings incl. this['m']()). Non-literal key -> external placeholder named <computed>, method construct, never a row (pinned even on a typed receiver). Corpus: +1/+20/+5/+105 <computed> edges; no io tag changed."  # 74a1
